SOAP client wrapper (design notes):

- Proveer funciones:
  - create_client(wsdl, cert, key, ca_bundle, local_xsd_map)
  - create_preview(payload) -> lxml Element
  - send_signed_envelope(bytes) -> requests.Response

- Requisitos:
  - permitir fallback a enviar raw signed_bytes via requests
  - exponer history capture when using zeep (HistoryPlugin)
